# One extended regex per line, matched against "path:line-text". Each rule needs a reason.
#
# Datastore-contract tests assert that inline credentials are detected, redacted and never echoed; they need URIs that
# carry obviously fake fixture credentials. Only these exact fixtures, and only under test sources.
^services/catalog-service/src/test/java/.*://(admin:s3cr3tpw|appuser:pw|appuser:s3cretPW|svc:p%40ss|svc:topsecret|u:p|u:pw)@
